    <string name="auth_notice">Security Notice: We strongly recommend using an Alternate Vehicle Authorization sub-account (created via the official BYD app) with remote vehicle permissions rather than your primary owner account. Independent unofficial third-party app.</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_title">First-Time Setup Guide (2nd Account &amp; PIN)</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_subtitle">How to prepare a secondary BYD account before signing in</string>
    <string name="btn_show_guide">Show</string>
    <string name="btn_hide_guide">Hide</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_warning">Do NOT use your main owner account. Authorize a separate 2nd BYD account in the official BYD App instead — this protects your primary login, prevents forced logouts, and lets you revoke access anytime.</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step1_title">1. Create a 2nd BYD Account</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step1_body">Sign out of the official BYD App and register a 2nd account with a separate email in the same country/region as your vehicle.</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step2_title">2. Authorize Vehicle from Main Account</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step2_body">Log into your Main Owner Account in the official BYD App → select your car → Vehicle Management / Vehicle Authorization (Car Sharing) → Add Authorized Account → enter your 2nd account email and enable Remote Control permissions (AC, Lock/Unlock).</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step3_title">3. Accept Invite &amp; Set 6-Digit PIN</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step3_body">Log into the official BYD App with the 2nd account and accept the share invite. Set a 6-digit Operation PIN under Profile → Settings → Operation Password (or when prompted on first remote Lock/AC), and verify remote Lock/AC works in the official app first.</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step4_title">4. Enter 2nd Account Here &amp; Fetch VIN</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_step4_body">Pick your matching Cloud Region below, enter your 2nd account email, password, and 6-digit PIN, then tap Fetch Vehicles &amp; Test Login (VIN fills automatically).</string>
